            "title": "Soil Preparation",
            "description": "Conditioning these samples for testing.",
            "image": [
              {
                "key": "99fa91dd-5781-4637-b96d-075293ff9e71",
                "mediaKey": "10f9f412-26d9-4f60-9ded-6bae124f7db2"
